KitStack Community License 1.0

Plain-language summary (not a substitute for the terms below):
KitStack is source-available. It is free to use for any noncommercial
purpose, free to evaluate, and free for commercial use by any company with
US $1,000,000 or less in total revenue in its prior tax year. If you
distribute the software or a work based on it, you must credit KitStack and
release your version under this same license. Companies above the revenue
threshold that want to use the software commercially must obtain a separate
commercial license from the licensor.

This license is based on the PolyForm Small Business License 1.0.0
(https://polyformproject.org/licenses/small-business/1.0.0/), modified to (a)
gate free commercial use on revenue alone, without an employee-count
condition, (b) grant an explicit evaluation right to everyone, and (c) add
attribution and share-alike requirements to the Notices and Changes and New
Works sections.

